(E-Commerce me → theme switch / filter selection)

To-Do List → add/remove items in a list
(E-Commerce me → add/remove products in cart)

2. Lists & Props

🔹 Chhote Projects:

Render List of Products (static JSON)

Show product cards from array
(E-Commerce me → product catalog)

Reusable Card Component

Pass data as props (title, price, image)
(E-Commerce me → ProductCard, CartItem)

3. Conditional Rendering

🔹 Chhote Projects:

Accordion (FAQ) → open/close toggle
(E-Commerce me → product description, filter section)

Show/Hide Cart → toggle a section
(E-Commerce me → cart page open/close)

4. Forms & Input Handling

🔹 Chhote Projects:

Login Form → handle input fields
(E-Commerce me → user authentication)

Checkout Form → shipping address input
(E-Commerce me → order placement)

5. State Management Practice

🔹 Chhote Projects:

Shopping Cart Mini Project

Add products to cart, remove them
(E-Commerce ke liye direct practice)

Quantity Increment/Decrement

Like counter but for each item
(E-Commerce me → update product qty in cart)

6. API Integration

🔹 Chhote Projects:

Fetch Posts (JSONPlaceholder)

Show data from API
(E-Commerce me → fetch products from backend)

Search & Filter Data

Search in a list
(E-Commerce me → search bar, category filter)

7. Routing

🔹 Chhote Projects:

Multi-Page App (Home, About, Contact)

React Router basics
(E-Commerce me → Home, Cart, Product Detail)

8. Advanced Features

🔹 Chhote Projects:

Authentication Mock

Login/Logout toggle with context
(E-Commerce me → user login system)

Wishlist / Favorites

Save liked products
(E-Commerce me → wishlist feature)

🏁 Final Project: E-Commerce App

Navbar (cart count, search)

Product List (cards from API/JSON)

Product Detail (routing + dynamic id)

Cart Page (add/remove/update qty)

Checkout (form handling)

Search & Filter (API + state)

User Login (mock auth or real backend later)

👉 Ye steps agar tum systematically follow karoge to har feature tumhare liye natural lagne lagega.

